{
  "name": "CokeAI｜ybkjs 商品镜像同步（每小时）",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ybkjs 商品镜像同步\n\n每小时拉一次 fk1.ybkjs.top 的公开目录（/static/catalog.json），更新小店商品的标题、介绍、售价和库存状态。\n\n- 只镜像商品，订单仍由人工采购，不向上游下单\n- 售价由 autoRetailPrice 按成本和目标毛利算出，不按拿货价直卖\n- 库存为 0 的商品保持上架，availability 记为 out_of_stock\n- 连续两次在目录里找不到才暂停，避免上游列表抖动误伤\n- 标题和文案经 sanitizeSupplierCopy 处理，公开页面不出现上游店铺名\n- 单款抓取失败保留旧内容，结果写入 shop_sync_runs\n\n手动：后台脚本 `docker compose exec app node ybkjs-sync.cjs`，或带 secret 调 `POST /api/internal/shop/ybkjs-sync`。",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b0278bf9-9424-4032-9660-362d1fc77a28",
      "name": "使用说明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "53 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "f5460402-e9f9-4a2b-a9d4-88b4b3f5dde2",
      "name": "每小时 :53",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://app:3000/api/internal/shop/ybkjs-sync",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.INTERNAL_API_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
